1 trailing line: one nanosecond units
2 trailing line: the shared header
5-6 line: The adder of the test bench. A second line of the same block.
8 line: strings
11 trailing line: a comment after an escaped backslash
12 trailing line: integer division
14 line: escaped identifiers end at whitespace
16 trailing line: after the escaped identifier
17 trailing line: a quote inside an escaped identifier
18 trailing line: an apostrophe inside an escaped identifier
20 line: based and sized literals
21 trailing line: it's "quoted" in a comment
22 trailing line: a sized literal with z and x
24 line: attributes
28 trailing line: a space before the parenthesis
30 trailing block: after an attribute
32-33 block: a block comment over two lines // with a slash pair inside
34 block: not /* nested
35 line: a line comment with /* an opener
36 trailing line: and */ a closer
37 trailing line: a division then a comment
